#*
#*   Script Name:	tpRetrieveTar	
#*
#*   Purpose:
#*	Retrieve <files> from <device> at the <tape_offset> th EOF.
#*	log the status on status_file file if an error occur.
#*
#*   Date		: Feb 2, 1998 
#*
#*   SCCS data		: @(#)
